# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC (github.com/genaforvena/self-adint, visibility PUBLIC — check with
# `gh repo view --json visibility` before trusting this line). Everything tracked here —
# README, PLAN, CLAUDE.md, docs/, tools/, receiver/, ref/, android/ — is world-readable.
# What the patterns below keep out is the RAW CAPTURE, which is where his device identifiers
# and his profile live. They are not a privacy boundary around the whole tree; there is no
# such boundary. Before committing anything derived from a capture, assume a reader on the
# internet: quote an advertising ID at the repo's eight-char convention, never in full, and
# keep IMEI / MSISDN / precise location out of prose entirely.
*.jsonl
*.pcap
.env
data/

# Android build output — the APK is a build product, not a source artifact
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/local.properties
